{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ef6342f16c1128b93e016cb5c710adf4a6dd3f1beb17fc29bc1d8cea1880d9d", "ja": "（大阪での仕事を終え、奈緒の案内で観光名所を回って\nいたが、少し前からファンの対応に追われている……）", "zh": "（在大阪的工作结束后，在奈绪的带领下游览了各处名胜，但从刚才开始就一直忙着应付粉丝……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1001_funa", "source_sha256": "b3dc34faebf614a8b31f8e477b440236d8a7e6df307001772a44c5476c12de58", "ja": "写真ありがとうございました！\n奈緒ちゃんのこと、これからも応援します！", "zh": "谢谢你的照片！\n今后我也会继续支持奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "8760a4ad2b1badc64ab510f18b41340d20c6478eef8164fa65872a38e0e292a3", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとう！\nメッチャ頑張るから、劇場にも遊びに来てな～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你！\n我会超级努力的，所以记得也来剧场玩哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "c4fa3558e5fcc6daa5a5ed2a3a24892237d8de03713566206ae4f1b30d2c04ed", "ja": "ふぅ、お待たせしました！　すみません、\nせっかく観光してたのに、待たせてしもうて……。", "zh": "呼，久等了！抱歉啊，难得出来观光，却让你等了这么久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f31761dc75b72d60ac1afc5a2ea0a1b0ffd0778b37efcea14f164bf1e014a153", "ja": "いや、構わないよ。それにしても、\nずいぶんたくさんの人に声をかけられたな。", "zh": "没关系，我不介意。话虽如此，\n刚才还真被不少人搭话了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "a09fa291e2a10e129f1a87fcc30f9f8c2308ceee9ce578ee2d2fdb1628d50bcc", "ja": "私もビックリしました。\nまさか、こんなに声かけてもらえるなんて……。", "zh": "我也吓了一跳。没想到居然会有这么多人主动跟我搭话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "9a82f74093d639937820542bf5d5fbb4fa1e402354b9610618b7bc431424e899", "ja": "これも、この服の効果やったりして～。\nデザインも特徴的ですし、メッチャ目立ちますもんね！", "zh": "说不定也是这身衣服的效果哦～  \n设计也很有特色，确实特别显眼嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6ff7f7a44cb5e8569032d7196c561663ae06e268ff99aa13f817322119579552", "ja": "それもあるだろうけど……奈緒の人の良さやオーラ、\n貫禄なんかも理由じゃないかな？", "zh": "或许也有这个原因……但我觉得，奈绪你人很好、自带气场，再加上那股气势，也是引人注目的理由吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "788bef88a3ca3bf031f8021a68295386348a43de023c50f5dd63d7198851b06f", "ja": "オーラとか貫禄って……\nあははっ！　まるで私が芸能人みたいやないですか！", "zh": "气场什么的，还有气势……\n啊哈哈！说得我好像是明星一样，不是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2ac7a90a497368ea777f1c13a497c3f8cf340d06b4ca26d897e48e6c419be30c", "ja": "そうそう。正真正銘の芸能人……\n関西の星・アイドル横山奈緒！　だろ？", "zh": "没错没错。货真价实的明星……\n关西之星·偶像横山奈绪！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "fd27ef9d49d79b7d0d7511c6fd0b2914b2c6a4f8e1b46337680f41f369c6c55e", "ja": "それは、そうなんですけど……\nなんや改まって言われると、ムズムズしますね。", "zh": "话是这么说没错……\n可被这么一本正经地说出来，总觉得怪不好意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "41a71d0585881892a6d80fb70f7b020b34c3ad4085ccee84b7ebd383b33b4489", "ja": "地元なんもあるんやろうけど、いつもとちゃう格好でも\n私やって、みんな気づいてくれますし……。", "zh": "虽说也有因为是老家的缘故，但就算打扮得和和平时不一样，\n大家也还是能认出我来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "af5e72fed94fa44d3887182be6c4bf98cf28875ae7e95e20c032e876c25c485d", "ja": "普段から、私のこと応援してくれてるんやなぁって\nわかって……。メッチャ嬉しいです♪", "zh": "就能感受到，大家平时也一直在支持我呢……真的超开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8d341be3b2d28848071985a398c358da5ae235ce12156b970314357184f0ecd1", "ja": "よかったな。奈緒の頑張りをみんなが見てくれて、\n応援してくれてる……。", "zh": "太好了。奈绪的努力大家都有看在眼里，\n也都在为你加油……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1014_p", "source_sha256": "568db177ce1dead8e9884c66e95a7d6c71d623bdd450a41c63c3a9b8e076483e", "ja": "それがよくわかった気がするよ。\nここに来て、よかった。", "zh": "我感觉自己真正明白了这一点。\n能来到这里，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "38397b7fdbd6c51bcf3ab073bea42fb9f6d2e9f50f521d238aea2bbd2b15ace4", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nはい。私も、ここに来られてよかったです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n是的。我也觉得能来到这里真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "64cc375f8c1bffd08775cb97b83d832c9628c927893d2b17c2e147ee8a4914d2", "ja": "せやけど、この後の観光、大丈夫かな……？\n大阪の魅力、もっと堪能してもらいたいんですけど。", "zh": "不过，接下来的观光行程没问题吗……？\n我还想让您更充分地领略大阪的魅力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1017_funb", "source_sha256": "ba9dad8ea44fa5f0515dfacc3f7f862bcc2f6247286393f56f0b82ed918de7fc", "ja": "あ……えっ、もしかして横山奈緒ちゃん！？　私、いつ\nも応援してます！　その服も、すごくカッコイイ……！", "zh": "啊……咦，难道你就是横山奈绪吗！？我一直都在支持你！那身衣服也特别帅气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "d7960947abd21813886fb456dedca008ea81dbe04ac853bc0f1be3f0a1db6b49", "ja": "ホンマに！？　えへへ、いつもありがとうな！\nこの服、私が考えてん！　良かったら着てみてな～！", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿，一直以来谢谢你啦！\n这身衣服是我自己设计的！你愿意的话，也试着穿穿看吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "f9b8d30cb195a2a9c80e08bca70066b621549acc2142221c7a6c5a8a0e2d8471", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}さん。\n観光は、また別の機会でもいいですか？", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生。\n观光的话，改天再去可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1020_p", "source_sha256": "91954f612df529aaf47b1853cb5f3a2048ef92fac5e21594bf96e97c9ea3b5a0", "ja": "ははっ、もちろん。\n今日はゆっくり地元の人たちと触れ合おう。", "zh": "哈哈，当然可以。\n今天就慢慢和当地人接触交流吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0554_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "6cf3480aeb6dbda79cb6997afa757d6aa38d0754e938885d53285a341d9ae645", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　……よっしゃー！\nファンサのついでに、服の宣伝もしまくるで～！", "zh": "谢谢！……好嘞——！\n趁着给粉丝送福利的机会，也要好好宣传一下服装～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
